Vibress Third-Party Notices
============================

Vibress incorporates work from the following third-party packages.
All packages are listed with their respective licenses as declared in
their package metadata. Full license texts are available in each
package's repository or via `pnpm licenses list`.

License Summary
---------------

The following license types appear across Vibress dependencies:

  MIT               (majority of dependencies)
  Apache-2.0        (AWS SDK, others)
  BSD-2-Clause
  BSD-3-Clause
  ISC
  0BSD
  BlueOak-1.0.0
  CC-BY-4.0
  CC0-1.0
  MIT-0
  MPL-2.0
  Python-2.0
  Unlicense
  (MIT AND Zlib)    (pako)

All licenses are permissive and compatible with the MIT license under
which Vibress is distributed.

